. title "Extract broad categories of agreement types for each reference from feature-level data"


{res}*******************************************************************************
*******************************************************************************
*****                                                                     *****
*****                                                                     *****
*****Extract broad categories of agreement types for each reference from feature-level data*****
*****                                                                     *****
*****                                                                     *****
